    {
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "<b>Solo</b> (alone / only) and <b>este, ese, aquel</b> (demonstratives) no longer need an accent (RAE 2010), even if the sentence is ambiguous.",
        "<b>Indirect questions</b> keep the accent: <i>No sé qué quiere. Dime cómo se llama. Pregunta dónde vive.</i>",
        "<b>Por qué / porque / porqué</b> as in B1: <i>¿Por qué? Porque ... El porqué.</i>"
      ]
    },
